{"ID":"20250919145831-3ema0jv","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250919145831-3ema0jv","title":"UPL6-4——GPU Instancing","type":"doc","updated":"20251121135801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919145831-86zmkr0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250919145831-86zmkr0","updated":"20251121135801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Instancing"}]},{"ID":"20250919150059-a730o9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150059-a730o9v","updated":"20250919150106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Instancing 就是 GPU 实例化的意思，它是一种减少 Draw Call，提高渲染效率 的技术，主要用来批量绘制大量相同的网格（Mesh）对象"}]},{"ID":"20250919150109-mrc906x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150109-mrc906x","updated":"20250919150254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它的主要原理，当开启 GPU Instancing 后，Unity 会将一份 网格 和 材质 上传到 GPU，并且还会传递一批 实例数据（里面包含每个物体的位置、旋转、缩放、颜色等等）\nGPU 收到数据后，会通过对象的实例化 ID 找到对应的参数，动态计算世界坐标，让 GPU 在一次 DrawCall 中绘制出许多相同的对象"}]},{"ID":"20250919150258-baq6ie2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150258-baq6ie2","updated":"20250919150314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说人话：GPU Instancing 利用 CPU 一次 DrawCall 告诉 GPU 的数据，GPU 自己根据数据绘制 N 个不同但是材质相同、网格相同的对象"}]},{"ID":"20250919150257-5ko67xg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150257-5ko67xg","updated":"20250919150341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：CPU 只通过一次 DrawCall 告诉 GPU 要绘制树，同时告诉了 GPU 这里 n 棵树的坐标、旋转、缩放、颜色等等数据，GPU 就利用这些数据批量的绘制 n 棵树"}]},{"ID":"20250919150352-flpx2pm","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250919150352-flpx2pm","updated":"20250919150402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250919150355-1sw8c16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150355-1sw8c16","updated":"20250919150355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250919150358-muzal6w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919150358-muzal6w","updated":"20250919150402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919150402-al81fbk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919150402-al81fbk","updated":"20250919150402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919150402-tq2qnpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150402-tq2qnpj","updated":"20250919150443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Instancing 和 动态和静态批处理 的原理区别"}]},{"ID":"20250919150417-h3elzvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150417-h3elzvv","updated":"20250919150529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态和静态批处理，它们都需要在 CPU 端合并网格，再告诉 GPU，一个批次依然是一个大网格，这样在 CPU 端有 合并计算 和 内存 的开销\n而 GPU Instancing 中 CPU 不会有太多额外开销（因为它只负责传递数据，并不再计算），而是把开销交给了 GPU\n因为需要在 GPU 中根据数据进行更多矩阵运算，来绘制对象"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919150402-3y3k5p2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919150402-3y3k5p2","updated":"20250919150402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919150402-d2xp3wi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150402-d2xp3wi","updated":"20250919150405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个对象同时开启它们时，优先级为：静态批处理 \u003e GPU Instancing \u003e 动态批处理"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152140-nihae2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152140-nihae2l","updated":"20251121135801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 还提供了相关 API 配合 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250919145831-86zmkr0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"GPU Instancing"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 使用"}]},{"ID":"20250919150559-apc67vf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250919150559-apc67vf","updated":"20250919151625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何开启 GPU Instancing"}]},{"ID":"20250919150606-pnq57lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150606-pnq57lr","updated":"20250919151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在想要进行 GPU Instancing 对象的材质球中，勾选 Enable GPU Instancing，在 任意渲染管线 和 Shader 中都可使用"}]},{"ID":"20250919150617-7mcrgr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919150617-7mcrgr0","updated":"20250919150738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250919150738-hw9hm20.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250919151625-50vknp0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250919151625-50vknp0","updated":"20250919152006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Instancing 的使用限制"}]},{"ID":"20250919151634-a7djjx8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919151634-a7djjx8","updated":"20250919151951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919151648-ihon6er","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-ihon6er","updated":"20250919151648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919151648-1yylt8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-1yylt8p","updated":"20250919151648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相同网格"}]},{"ID":"20250919151649-w9ra2wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151649-w9ra2wt","updated":"20250919151654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有想要进行 GPU Instancing 处理的对象必须使用同一网格"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919151648-iehezyn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-iehezyn","updated":"20250919151951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919151648-b0o05pw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-b0o05pw","updated":"20250919151700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相同材质（颜色、额外属性可以变化；贴图、Shader 关键字不能变化）"}]},{"ID":"20250919151703-g35nrhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151703-g35nrhy","updated":"20250919151951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有对象必须使用同一材质，并且 Shader 必须支持 GPU Instancing\nUnity 中默认 Shader 都支持它，如果是自定义 Shader，满足基本处理（不要求不同颜色等属性）只需要加入编译指令："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"#pragma multi_compile_instancing"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n如果想要支持不同颜色、金属度、透明度等等，可以查看官方文档："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/2022.3/Manual/gpu-instancing-shader.html","TextMarkTextContent":"Creating shaders that support GPU instancing - Unity 手册"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919151648-dztp5lo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-dztp5lo","updated":"20250919151648"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919151648-ca6537j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-ca6537j","updated":"20250919151648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"必须启用材质球上的 Enable GPU Instancing"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919151648-hd083wo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-hd083wo","updated":"20250919151829"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919151648-9xukr1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151648-9xukr1m","updated":"20250919151818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不支持 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SkinnedMeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（蒙皮网格渲染器）"}]},{"ID":"20250919151821-7caykgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151821-7caykgz","updated":"20250919151829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只支持 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或者 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Graphics.RenderMesh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等 API 绘制的网格"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919151644-9z1dz39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919151644-9z1dz39","updated":"20250919151644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250919152006-g8y55vb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250919152006-g8y55vb","updated":"20250919152136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适合使用 GPU Instancing 的情况"}]},{"ID":"20250919152015-aymownz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152015-aymownz","updated":"20250919152105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适合的情况"}]},{"ID":"20250919152105-6dbz7sa","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-6dbz7sa","updated":"20250919152118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152105-is342zy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-is342zy","updated":"20250919152105"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152105-mvgsdc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-mvgsdc8","updated":"20250919152105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量相同物体时"}]},{"ID":"20250919152106-onjb11z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152106-onjb11z","updated":"20250919152106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如草地、森林、石头、瓦片、建筑模型、子弹 等等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152105-02ymuno","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-02ymuno","updated":"20250919152118"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152105-w3gvrr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-w3gvrr9","updated":"20250919152105"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实例之间只有少量差异"}]},{"ID":"20250919152107-mri8tei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152107-mri8tei","updated":"20250919152118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同颜色或亮度、不同缩放比例、不同 UV 偏移等等"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152105-k7hhnsb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-k7hhnsb","updated":"20250919152117"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152105-8ldjv23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152105-8ldjv23","updated":"20250919152117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态物体，但是网格和材质固定，性能瓶颈在 CPU 时"}]},{"ID":"20250919152109-nizf8tt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152109-nizf8tt","updated":"20250919152113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"动态批处理对 CPU 开销大；静态批处理又不能移动，GPU Instancing 则既能支持移动，又减少 CPU 到 GPU 通信"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152103-bqp0n0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152103-bqp0n0d","updated":"20250919152103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250919152018-ee0acey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152018-ee0acey","updated":"20250919152025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不适合的情况"}]},{"ID":"20250919152025-c5lg1x9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-c5lg1x9","updated":"20250919152059"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152025-51pxkdz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-51pxkdz","updated":"20250919152025"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152025-7xa3bbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-7xa3bbd","updated":"20250919152031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个物体的材质 / 贴图不同"}]},{"ID":"20250919152026-nj7j29f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152026-nj7j29f","updated":"20250919152026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU Instancing 要求材质一致，贴图差异会打断合批"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152025-vukzv81","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-vukzv81","updated":"20250919152025"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152025-arik03s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-arik03s","updated":"20250919152025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实例数量很少（几十个以内）"}]},{"ID":"20250919152027-6wxjrbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152027-6wxjrbj","updated":"20250919152037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种情况 GPU Instancing 开销可能反而比 DrawCall 更大"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152025-tl3aqgs","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-tl3aqgs","updated":"20250919152039"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152025-ac5xhjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-ac5xhjo","updated":"20250919152025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量独立的网格和材质"}]},{"ID":"20250919152039-v7a0eje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152039-v7a0eje","updated":"20250919152039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果对象种类太多，GPU Instancing 没啥用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152025-u12fida","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-u12fida","updated":"20250919152059"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250919152025-8wpi4db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152025-8wpi4db","updated":"20250919152059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SkinnedMeshRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（蒙皮网格渲染器）"}]},{"ID":"20250919152041-cvs409l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152041-cvs409l","updated":"20250919152053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨骼动画模型不支持 GPU Instancing"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250919152020-ketw8vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152020-ketw8vj","updated":"20250919152020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250919152136-h0k3phc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250919152136-h0k3phc","updated":"20250919152136"}}]}